---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /work/
title: Work
shortTitle: Work
description: Six case studies on AI evaluation systems, production monitoring and test infrastructure, each with an explicit section on what I would do differently.
---
<article class="page">
    <header class="page__header">
        <div class="wrap wrap--measure">
            <h1 class="page__title">Work</h1>
            <p class="page__lede">
                Six systems, written up in full: the problem, what could not be changed, the options
                I did not take, the mechanism, the results, and what I would do differently. The
                last of those is not a formality. Every one of these has open items, and they are
                labelled.
            </p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="wrap wrap--measure">
        {% architectureNote %}
    </div>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="case-studies-title">
        <div class="wrap">
            <h2 class="section__title" id="case-studies-title">Case studies</h2>

            <ul class="card-list card-list--posts">
                {% for item in collections.caseStudies %}
                <li class="card card--case-study" data-reveal>
                    <p class="card__eyebrow">
                        <span>Case study {{ item.data.number }}</span>
                        <span>{{ item.data.period }}</span>
                    </p>
                    <h3 class="card__title"><a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.data.title }}</a></h3>
                    <p class="card__body">{{ item.data.description }}</p>
                    <ul class="chips">
                        {% for tech in item.data.stack | limit(4) %}<li class="chip">{{ tech }}</li>{% endfor %}
                    </ul>
                </li>
                {% endfor %}
            </ul>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="oss" aria-labelledby="other-title">
        <div class="wrap wrap--measure">
            <h2 class="section__title" id="other-title">Other systems I built or own</h2>
            <p>
                These did not warrant a case study. They are here because breadth is part of the
                honest picture of a sole-QA role, and because two of them are where I learned things
                that show up everywhere else on this site.
            </p>

            <ul class="other-systems">
                {% for project in projects.other %}
                <li class="other-systems__item" data-reveal>
                    <h3 class="card__title">
                        {% if project.url %}<a href="{{ project.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ project.title }}</a>{% else %}{{ project.title }}{% endif %}
                    </h3>
                    <p class="card__eyebrow">{{ project.period }}</p>
                    <ul class="chips">
                        {% for tech in project.tech %}<li class="chip">{{ tech }}</li>{% endfor %}
                    </ul>
                    <p class="card__body">{{ project.body }}</p>
                    {% if project.metric %}<p class="card__meta">{% metric project.metric %}</p>{% endif %}
                    {% if project.relatedPost %}<p class="card__meta"><a href="{{ project.relatedPost | url }}">The general version of this lesson</a></p>{% endif %}
                </li>
                {% endfor %}
            </ul>
        </div>
    </section>
</article>
